  "solution": {
    "text": "<blockquote><p>Given,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>15</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>19</mn><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>285</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfrac><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mn>19</mn></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mfrac><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mn>15</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math></p><p>Now plotting the diagram with given circle of radius&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>4</mn></math>&nbsp;we get,&nbsp;</p><p><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/3be956de-1396-4fa1-a50a-75edc5a155d8.png\" style=\"width: 300px; height: 217px;\" /></p><p>Now, let the equation of tangent of ellipse be&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>m</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>&#177;</mo><msqrt><mn>19</mn><msup><mi>m</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>15</mn></msqrt></math>&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced close=\"}\" open=\"{\"><mrow><mtext>as</mtext><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi>c</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>a</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><msup><mi>m</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>b</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p>If it is tangent to circle&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>16</mn></math>&nbsp;then using the formula,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>c</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>r</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>m</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced></math>&nbsp;we get,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><msqrt><mn>19</mn><msup><mi>m</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>15</mn></msqrt><msqrt><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>m</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></msqrt></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>19</mn><msup><mi>m</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>15</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>16</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>16</mn><msup><mi>m</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>3</mn><msup><mi>m</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>m</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>&#177;</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>&#952;</mi><mo>=</mo><msup><mn>30</mn><mo>&#176;</mo></msup></math>&nbsp;with&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo></math>axis,</p><p>Hence,&nbsp; Angle made by tangent with minor axis i.e., with <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>y</mi></math> axis is&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#960;</mi><mn>3</mn></mfrac></math></p></blockquote>",
